# PikMoolya — Phase 1

PikMoolya: "Don't just know the price. Know the best way to sell."

Phase 1 is the system-design foundation. It defines architecture, database schema,
roles/permissions, API contracts, AI/ML architecture, security, mobile/web architecture,
and project structure.

IMPORTANT:
- Do not build Phase 2 backend code yet.
- Save this folder inside your main `pikmoolya/` project.
- Phase 2 will implement the backend against this design.
